PROJECT NAME: The Beauty Edit. 

PROJECT DESCRIPTION: The Beauty Edit is a beauty discovery and wishlist application designed for beauty lovers who enjoy exploring skincare, makeup and beauty products. The app allows users to search beauty products using an external API, view product information and save their favorite products to a personalized wishlist. Users can organize their saved products, add personal notes, update their purchase status and remove products they no longer want. The goal is to create a simple and visually appealing platform that helps users keep track of beauty products they are interested in purchasing.

API: https://dummyjson.com/docs/products

DATA: {id,productName,brand,category, price, priority, status, notes, dateAdded}

USER STORY #1: As a beauty shopper, I want to save products to my wishlist so that I can keep track of items I am interested in buying.

USER STORY #2: As a beauty enthusiast, I want to browse beauty products so that I can discover products I might want to purchase.

USER STORY #3: As a user, I want to edit my saved products so that I can update my notes, purchase status and priority.

