Search bar

Users can search for beauty products by:
- Product name
- Brand
Category filter

Users can filter products by:
- All
- Beauty
- Skin care
- Fragrances what users can search or filter by

BUSINESS LOGIC: Total wishlist items, Total wishlist value,Purchased versus unpurchased items 

